# Regenerable / heavy build artifacts from a fresh pipeline run -- not
# checked in since they're large and reproduce automatically via
# `python run_pipeline.py`. Archived past-run evidence under
# outputs/results/run*/ IS checked in (see the exceptions below) since
# that's small, real evidence worth keeping in the repo history.
outputs/scalograms/
outputs/models/
outputs/gradcam/*.png
outputs/results/*.png
outputs/results/*.txt
outputs/results/*.npz
!outputs/results/run*/
